      "finding": "The bow carrying arm, drawing hand and bow silhouette remain coherent through the retained releases and exact late recovery/reset boundaries. The new material silhouette is clearer and richer green. No gross detached bow or torn hero mesh is visible in these sampled pixels; precise nock contact is too small to certify."
